OL,3,AWoman injures three people in third
OL,4,APoland school knife attack in a week
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Warsaw police spokesperson said they
OL,7,Fcould not confirm whether the latest
OL,8,Fincident was related to the two
OL,9,Fprevious attacks.
